### get office administrator | office administrator

GET {{baseUrl}}/todolist?page=1&limit=20&searchTerm=ce ad HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{administrator}}


### create todolist | office administrator

POST {{baseUrl}}/todolist/create HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{administrator}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignedId": "69d4a601d6abcd8d33b7480c",
  "description": "Resolve JWT expiration issue on refresh",
  "title": "Fix login bug"
}


### get todolists | office administrator

GET {{baseUrl}}/todolist/all?page=1&limit=20&searchTerm=ce ad HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{administrator}}


### get todo details | office administrator

# details/:todoId

GET {{baseUrl}}/todolist/details/69da29e5dfa5d73a33f69e07 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{administrator}}


### update todo | office administrator

# update/:todoId

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/todolist/update/69d4bd4305122ee84934a4bb HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{administrator}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Resolve JWT expiration issue on refresh",
  "isComplete": true,
  "title": "Fix login bug"
}
